{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "fb5e8507c6d8188c309142e8be20b2fc1c9536742a1592b6b826fa5403adc1a3", "ja": "ライブMC　～コール&レスポンス～", "zh": "演唱会MC　～呼喊&回应～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d45a66527c3dc6b8b5a9a18bbe999d59b2bbab6d006da0632a6ef637b983a134", "ja": "MC中、観客を沸かせるまつりと朋花。莉緒\nも負けじとそれに続く。やよいも客席にハイ\nタッチを促し、会場はひとつになった。", "zh": "主持中，茉莉与朋花点燃了观众的热情。莉绪\n也不甘示弱地紧随其后。弥生也号召观众席\n击掌，全场融为了一体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "b00899f5b4e358286c0c32aa9cf59a497525b697bc554181974b7e30ce276c0b", "ja": "まつり達のライブ、楽しんでるのですー？　\nみんなの声を聞かせて欲しいのです！　はいほー！", "zh": "茉莉她们的演出，大家玩得开心吗——？\n想听到大家的声音呢！Haiho——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "cd08c20af5dae0e78b9dc85fc4557cde76f770926c2e0276250670c48fe54a2f", "ja": "はいほー！！", "zh": "嗨呼——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "6aadc84597e82be0ff61134d2bfd3dd424895a136ee21d8e4eba4ceabf81d3de", "ja": "うっうー！　ありがとうございまーす！\nみんな、元気いーっぱいですねっ！", "zh": "呜～呜～！非常感谢大家——！\n大家都超级有活力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "b26d6bc64c77d6ae020f836c6269fd08974821d0a2dfed885a9b018d045f383e", "ja": "ほんと、すごい歓声ね！　それに、この一体感！\nまつりちゃん、コール＆レスポンスもバッチリね♪", "zh": "真的，好热烈的欢呼声啊！而且，现场还有这种浑然一体的感觉！茉莉，呼喊互动也配合得非常完美呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "e2274656f731be97f4d01865ce1189e93ce1f55499ee053af5063e10dad1db7f", "ja": "ありがとうなのです！　……ほ？　今度は客席から、\n朋花ちゃんを呼ぶ声が聞こえてくるのです！", "zh": "谢谢你！……咦？这次从观众席那边，\n传来了呼唤朋花的声音呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "9e6d09664327121df9418c98d2e4db09d72b6d6a34586ff9ad20f4ebd1c62ab4", "ja": "朋花さまー！　朋花さまーー！！", "zh": "朋花大人——！　朋花大人———！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "d812bea7f54437620b76f4a5ddcb17e066c08e2d4d5cca0e891719f77c1ad076", "ja": "感心ですね～。子豚ちゃん達の厚い忠誠心、\nちゃんと聖母に伝わっていますよ～♪", "zh": "真令人佩服呢～小猪们这份深厚的忠诚心意，圣母已经好好感受到了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "2420215cba057f1d6a58afd4cde47676bda822c7973be94a02df7dbb48da6c6f", "ja": "まだまだライブは続きますから。\n最後まで、楽しんでくださいね～。", "zh": "演唱会还会继续进行哦。\n请享受到最后吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "60c15220570c8e4143da3a31e2d273845cc909457eddae7b24052277daff4ee6", "ja": "なんだか、みんなと一緒に\n大きな声を出すと楽しいですね！", "zh": "总觉得，和大家一起大声喊出来，\n很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_02_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "03f6ccff4542df6d566e65245028e9f1fb77b089526e4ba29e05ae7f11cd5b3b", "ja": "私もやってみようかしら……。はい、\n私のセクシーさにメロメロになっちゃった人ーっ！？", "zh": "我也试试看吧……好——有没有人已经被我的性感迷得神魂颠倒啦——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
